{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1811.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"f8fd4a6a7e60ac59dffa4116e410213c25d37b7ec925111fe38b30cc8ea8f0bc","ja":"難航する調査","zh":"进展不顺的调查","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1811.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"c40f80373994b115ac5f3f322ec89f30aadf1409471ae824c95121ffddd7709a","ja":"みんなは、雪女の噂を聞いたことがある人に\n話を聞くことになって……","zh":"大家决定去采访听说过雪女传闻的人……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1811.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ca7f8dd0f0fd537488a3aa279b9eccef26dfd1ff2b4b5218187bc4cef986d07d","ja":"目撃された雪女は、どんな姿だったのでしょう？\nやはり全身真っ白、でしょうか？","zh":"被目击到的雪女，究竟是什么样子的呢？\n果然是全身雪白吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1811.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"998d5fc8819cbe7e4866cb7a617f4c87e6edd5883abae704557bbfb456f132c7","ja":"「友達が見たらしいんだけど、\nものすごくきれいな女性の姿をしていた、って……」","zh":"“听说朋友见过，\n说是一个美得不得了的女人……”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1811.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"cac2e3fec8adf116ffcf067f8d23cace1380e5708112916b9a1454ae4aeb29a7","ja":"「それで、その美貌を目にした瞬間、凍らされた\nみたいに、その場を動けなくなったんだって！」","zh":"“然后，据说在看到那份美貌的瞬间，就像被冻住了一样，动弹不得了！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1811.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"36b91126788dc48237462a63097e0b90063cdc3c19a1e960a7f4e82d7fe97c1f","ja":"ひっ……そ、それは、怖いですね……。","zh":"吓……那、那个，真可怕……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1811.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"d7fcb51093fff2e31f410fd5bc18512c3282339009114e242bf84d986e321c1a","ja":"まさに雪女、って感じだね。\nどうしたら会えるんだろう……？","zh":"简直就像雪女一样呢。\n要怎样才能见到她呢……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1811.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"c03cbf36250f8d52f60c9ea68119d0f06bdd0591d99d8cb70a5130c92f9ffa08","ja":"……あっ、美味しいお料理を作ったら、\n匂いにつられて出てきたりしないかな！？","zh":"……啊，要是做出美味的料理，会不会被香味吸引出来呢！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1811.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"71db77134058cd7adce54f971d478e1f0f76e73effa596782ff15159293f3619","ja":"う～ん……でも雪女って、何を食べるのかナ？\nかき氷……とか？","zh":"嗯……不过雪女到底吃什么呢？\n刨冰……之类的？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1811.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"dbbbfb2da2c0b6bb31125af80bc7945fa1b1acc33eafe11d8a889ac24f29e6f7","ja":"そっか、何を食べるのか分からないね。\n中華料理が好きなら、嬉しいんだけど……。","zh":"这样啊，还不知道要吃什么呢。\n要是你喜欢中餐，我会很开心的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1811.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"d2a5f4692e5dfe816278c96073661622b6692a220c3821e7e65e609ae1a3319e","ja":"それからも、雪女の捜索を続けたが……","zh":"之后也继续寻找雪女，但是……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1811.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"f56c66cedac5ac661622fa75c47e8031d9d5a747d3a3680d4141b85557fa60ed","ja":"ず、ずいぶん歩きましたけど……、\n何も……み、見つかりませんね……。","zh":"走、走了好长一段路……，\n但是什么……什、什么都没找到呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1811.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"0af0f358d7a45144f8d26df47da9d497263d48f551b797eff753c6674ba49761","ja":"はい……あ、あそこに人がいます。\n何か知らないか、聞いてみましょう。","zh":"嗯……啊，那边有人。\n去问问他知不知道些什么吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1811.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"b9ac0e2e23c22b26e57e1504713c8a754a200e8a70a43eb3a1b4e9e9bde3a5d0","ja":"あの、すみません。インタビュー、\nいいでしょうか？　このあたりで……。","zh":"那个，不好意思。可以在这附近……采访一下吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1811.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"e01a391d1204360910c769042982c26160a70158cc0f1e1c8e0a2c53ade17a2c","ja":"「ひっ…………わ～～～っ！」","zh":"「啊……哇～～～！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1811.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"2e67cf8081e4372ab30f2e10e74ad1d592a5011f4f53d6bc7294cf163506f973","ja":"…………走って逃げてしまいました。\n……びっくりしたぞ。","zh":"…………跑掉了。  \n……吓我一跳。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1811.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"93909b12f3afdd6794bf6d2d1c2044766e4da390deb0146c8ceedf911c9ea744","ja":"な、なにがあったんでしょう……。\nわ、私達を見て、驚いたように見えましたけど……。","zh":"不、不知道发生什么事了……。\n看、看起来他看到我们后，好像吓了一跳……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1811.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"44fb1d3332069e5592b01521bb1c85c3f1dfc7bbc894805f97455086de4afd54","ja":"分かりません。噂だとこのあたりが有力なので、\n地元の方に、話を聞いてみたかったのですが。","zh":"我不清楚。听说这附近的可能性比较大，所以本想向当地人打听一下。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1811.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"854161b1e2d637507ada8bed77505380cae4b363a9d1540bbc67acb08c58d251","ja":"……あれ？　こ、このあたり……って、\nみ、見覚えがあるような……？","zh":"……咦？这、这一带……总觉得，\n好、好像在哪里见过……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1811.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"b73dd76917010ac2665b67282d953d533baa1cf80be64f13e76ce64f1cea7394","ja":"残り時間はもうあまり……篠宮さん？\nどうかしましたか？","zh":"剩下的时间已经不多了……篠宫小姐？\n您怎么了？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1811.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"375900575693acf25c05ac2982791c317cc5b1fe4ebb9370679b71a6dbbf2ffa","ja":"あ、えっと……な、何か忘れていることが\nある気がして……あ、いえ……な、なんでもないです。","zh":"啊，呃……总觉得好、好像忘了什么……啊，不，没、没什么。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
